# ── Z.AI SDK Configuration ──
# The z-ai-web-dev-sdk reads its configuration from a .z-ai-config JSON file
# at one of these locations (checked in order):
#   1. <project-root>/.z-ai-config
#   2. ~/.z-ai-config (home directory)
#   3. /etc/.z-ai-config
#
# The file must contain:
# {
#   "baseUrl": "https://api.z.ai/api",
#   "apiKey": "your-z-ai-api-key-here"
# }
#
# If this file is missing (e.g. in production Vercel), the /api/translate
# route gracefully returns the original text (HTTP 200, translated: false)
# instead of throwing an HTTP 500 error.

# ── Google Tag Manager (optional) ──
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID=GTM-XXXXXXX

# ── Database (set by Vercel automatically when linking Supabase) ──
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...
# DIRECT_URL=postgresql://...
